                "loc": "NUM.29.12+NUM.29.13+NUM.29.14+NUM.29.15+NUM.29.16+NUM.29.17+NUM.29.18+NUM.29.19+NUM.29.20+NUM.29.21+NUM.29.22+NUM.29.23+NUM.29.24+NUM.29.25+NUM.29.26+NUM.29.27+NUM.29.28+NUM.29.29+NUM.29.30+NUM.29.31+NUM.29.32+NUM.29.33+NUM.29.34+NUM.29.35+NUM.29.36+NUM.29.37+NUM.29.38"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kub 29:12-38",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Ni ku mbaga ey'Ekibinuko eky'Entindi, etoolera ku lunaku olweikumi n'eitaanu olw'omwezi ogwomusanvu, kyabazinga era aidha kukolanga mu nsambo n'endala eyo: buli lunaku okumala enaku omusanvu edh'ekibinuko, aidha kutangagho ebintu bityo olw'ekigheebwayo olw'ebibi, n'olw'ekigheebwayo ekyokebwa kyonakyona okuwaagho, n'olw'ekigheebwayo eky'emere ey'empeke. Era atengagho n'omuzigo ogw'ebibala eby'emiti emyoliva.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.25"
            ]
